1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,120
For everybody who keeps saying, it's not the guns, it's mental health.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:08,860
There's always been mental health issues, ever, like since the dawn of time.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:13,460
Because the brain is not perfect and because trauma is universal.

4
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:18,400
There have always been mental health issues, but there weren't always this many guns.

5
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,960
There weren't always this easy access to guns.

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:28,080
And there wasn't always this culture that you should just use guns to deal with your anger.

7
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:33,380
So we have to acknowledge that there is a chicken that came before the egg.

8
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:39,060
And then you brought in the egg and now the chicken keeps smashing the egg with the goddamn guns.

9
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,520
So we can't just keep saying, well, it's a mental health issue.

10
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,120
There will always be mental health.

11
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:55,120
There doesn't always have to be tools that people who are having mental health issues can use to misappropriate their struggles.

